				<h1 class="hero-name" style="font-size: clamp(4rem, 10vw, 9rem); line-height: 0.92; margin-bottom: 24px; letter-spacing: -0.03em;">
					HAUKE<br/>SCHNAU
				</h1>

				<p style="font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 600; max-width: 600px; margin-bottom: 28px; line-height: 1.4;">
					I ship type-safe code with AI&nbsp;superpowers.
				</p>

				<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; align-items: center;">
					<span class="sticker" style="background: var(--red); color: #fff; transform: rotate(1.5deg);">
						📍 Hamburg / Bremen, Germany
					</span>
					<span class="sticker" style="background: var(--yellow); transform: rotate(-1deg);">
						🎓 B.Sc. Computer Science, Uni Hamburg — GPA 1.47
					</span>
				</div>
			</div>
		</header>

		<!-- MARQUEE -->
		<div class="reveal" style="margin-top: 48px; border-top: var(--border-w) solid var(--border); border-bottom: var(--border-w) solid var(--border); background: var(--yellow); padding: 14px 0; overflow: hidden;">
			<div class="marquee-track" style="font-family: 'Archivo Black', sans-serif; font-size: 1.15rem; text-transform: uppercase; white-space: nowrap;">
