								<span class="sticker" style="background: var(--red); color: #fff; font-size: 0.75rem;">AI-Powered</span>
							</div>
							<p class="mono" style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: #666; margin-bottom: 12px;">2021 – 2022</p>
							<p style="font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px;">AI meets the living room.</p>
